---
// src/pages/about.astro — the syllabus. Edit the prose directly here.
import Section from '../layouts/Section.astro';
import Note from '../components/Note.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Section
  title="About more like Resume"
  aside="a.k.a. the syllabus (me)"
  lede="Computer science at Purdue, Indianapolis, by way of Haldwani, Uttarakhand."
>
  <div class="column prose">
    <Note>no tests. probably.</Note>
    <p>
      I like maths/physics/CS. I just explore problems, learn them and have
      my fun with them. I might explain them here in my blogs just as a way
      of solace and finality of actually learning stuff.
    </p>

    <h2>Education</h2>
    <h3>Purdue University, College of Science</h3>
    <p>BS Computer Science, expected May 2030. Chess Club, Computer Science Clu, SIM Racing Club.</p>
    <h3>Dikshant International School, Haldwani</h3>
    <p>High school, 2022 to 2026. AP Calculus BC and AP Physics C: Mechanics, both 5.</p>

    <h2 id="experience">Experience</h2>
    <h3>Software development intern, Design O’ Web</h3>
    <p class="when">2024 to 2025</p>
    <p>Built mobile application components in Flutter for production apps.</p>
    <h3>Independent researcher, AI ethics</h3>
    <p class="when">2025 to 2026</p>
    <p>
      Case studies on privacy, transparency, autonomy and fairness in AI, and a
      proposed oversight framework built around accountability.
    </p>

    <h2 id="awards">Awards</h2>
    <h3>Indian National Mathematical Olympiad</h3>
    <p class="when">2022, 2024, 2025</p>
    <Note tilt={2}>my proudest things ever ig?</Note>
    <p>Qualified three times; INMO Awardee in 2025.</p>
    <h3>NAEST</h3>
    <p class="when">2025</p>
    <p>
      First in state and top 40 nationally (top 0.1%). Worked with
      Dr. H.C. Verma, and in labs at IIT Kanpur.
    </p>

    <h2 id="contact">Office hours</h2>
    <Note>I'm better than your toxic Ex, I will reply</Note>
    <p>
      Any time, by email at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      Code lives on <a href={site.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  .prose > p:first-of-type { font-size: var(--s-1); line-height: 1.5; }
  .prose h2 { font-size: var(--s-3); margin: 4.5rem 0 1.25rem; }
  .prose h3 { font-family: var(--f-text); font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: 600;
              font-size: var(--s-0); line-height: 1.4; letter-spacing: 0; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .prose h3 + p { margin-top: 0.15rem; }
  .when { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--s--1); }
</style>
